msgid "Connect this machine to Wi-Fi or Ethernet, then reopen"
msgstr "ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ເຄື່ອງນີ້ກັບ Wi-Fi ຫຼື Ethernet ແລ້ວເປີດຄືນໃໝ່"

